Description: Telegram's WebRTC fork (static library)
 tg_owt is the reduced fork of Google's WebRTC that Telegram Desktop uses for
 voice and video calls and for screen sharing.
 .
 This package ships a static library, its headers and a CMake package
 configuration. There is no shared library and therefore no runtime package:
 anything linking tg_owt must be rebuilt when this package changes.
 .
 Built from the exact upstream commit that the corresponding Telegram Desktop
 release pins, with RNNoise enabled as upstream ships it.
